{"ref":"BDB, תָּפֵל²","hw":"תָּפֵל²","html":"† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">תָּפֵל</span></big>  <strong>n.</strong>[<strong>m.</strong>] <strong>whitewash</strong>;—applied to wall, in Ezekiel’s vision <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:10\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.10\">Ez 13:10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:11\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.14\">14</a>, <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 13:15\" href=\"/Ezekiel.13.15\">15</a>; fig. of false prophet <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 22:28\" href=\"/Ezekiel.22.28\">22:28</a>.","next":"BDB, תֹּ֫פֶל","prev":"BDB, תפל²"}